# Keep build contexts small and free of secrets.
.git
.github
.gitignore
.env
.env.*
!.env.example
**/target
**/node_modules
**/.next
**/out
**/dist
**/coverage
**/playwright-report
**/test-results
docs
*.md
!readme.md
.idea
.vscode
**/*.iml
.DS_Store
**/*.log
**/.m2
secrets/
*.p12
*.jks
*.pem
*.key
